---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Fix & Troubleshoot Car Problems"
  description="Diagnose and fix car problems yourself. Step-by-step troubleshooting guides for engine issues, brake problems, electrical faults, and more."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
    <nav class="mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-foreground/60">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-foreground">Home</a></li>
        <li>/</li>
        <li class="text-foreground">Fix & Troubleshoot</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-500 text-white">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-foreground">Fix & Troubleshoot</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg text-foreground/70 max-w-3xl">
        Car problems? We'll help you diagnose and fix them yourself. Our step-by-step guides 
        walk you through troubleshooting from symptoms to solutions, saving you hundreds in shop fees.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Start -->
    <div class="mb-12 rounded-2xl border border-accent/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/5 to-transparent p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">🚗 What's Wrong With Your Car?</h2>
      <p class="text-foreground/70 mb-6">
        Start by describing the symptoms. We'll guide you through the most likely causes and fixes.
      </p>
      
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <a href="/fix/car-wont-start-clicks" class="group rounded-lg border border-foreground/10 bg-background p-4 hover:bg-foreground/[.02] transition-colors">
          <div class="font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent">Won't Start (but clicks)</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-foreground/60 mt-1">Usually battery or starter issues</div>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/fix/car-wont-start-no-click" class="group rounded-lg border border-foreground/10 bg-background p-4 hover:bg-foreground/[.02] transition-colors">
          <div class="font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent">Won't Start (no click)</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-foreground/60 mt-1">Could be ignition or fuel system</div>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/fix/check-engine-light-on" class="group rounded-lg border border-foreground/10 bg-background p-4 hover:bg-foreground/[.02] transition-colors">
          <div class="font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent">Check Engine Light</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-foreground/60 mt-1">Read codes and understand meanings</div>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/fix/brakes-squealing" class="group rounded-lg border border-foreground/10 bg-background p-4 hover:bg-foreground/[.02] transition-colors">
          <div class="font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent">Squealing Brakes</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-foreground/60 mt-1">Worn pads or other brake issues</div>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/fix/car-overheating" class="group rounded-lg border border-foreground/10 bg-background p-4 hover:bg-foreground/[.02] transition-colors">
          <div class="font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent">Overheating</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-foreground/60 mt-1">Coolant system problems</div>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/fix/ac-not-blowing-cold" class="group rounded-lg border border-foreground/10 bg-background p-4 hover:bg-foreground/[.02] transition-colors">
          <div class="font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent">AC Not Cold</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-foreground/60 mt-1">Refrigerant or compressor issues</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Problem Categories -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">Browse by System</h2>
      
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <!-- Engine & Performance -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/5 to-transparent p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🏎️</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Engine & Performance</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-foreground/70 mb-4">
            Won't start, rough idle, stalling, check engine light, overheating
          </p>
          <a href="/fix/engine" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-700 font-medium">
            Diagnose Engine Issues →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Brakes -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/5 to-transparent p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🛑</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Brakes</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-foreground/70 mb-4">
            Squealing, grinding, soft pedal, pulling, vibration when braking
          </p>
          <a href="/fix/brakes" class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-700 font-medium">
            Fix Brake Problems →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Electrical & Battery -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-blue-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/5 to-transparent p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">⚡</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Electrical & Battery</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-foreground/70 mb-4">
            Dead battery, alternator problems, lights not working, parasitic draw
          </p>
          <a href="/fix/electrical" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-medium">
            Solve Electrical Issues →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- AC & Heating -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-transparent p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">❄️</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">AC & Heating</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-foreground/70 mb-4">
            No cold air, no heat, bad smells, compressor noise
          </p>
          <a href="/fix/ac-heating" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 font-medium">
            Fix Climate Control →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Suspension & Steering -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-purple-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/5 to-transparent p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🛞</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Suspension & Steering</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-foreground/70 mb-4">
            Clunking, pulling, uneven tire wear, shaking at speed
          </p>
          <a href="/fix/suspension" class="text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700 font-medium">
            Fix Handling Issues →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Noises & Smells -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-orange-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500/5 to-transparent p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">👂</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Noises & Smells</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-foreground/70 mb-4">
            Strange sounds, burning smells, clicking, grinding, squealing
          </p>
          <a href="/fix/noises-smells" class="text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700 font-medium">
            Identify Sounds & Smells →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Safety Notice -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/10 to-transparent p-8">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-600 text-white shrink-0">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 mb-2">Safety First</h3>
          <p class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">
            Always prioritize safety when working on your vehicle. Use proper safety equipment, 
            work in a well-ventilated area, and never work under a car supported only by a jack.
          </p>
          <div class="text-sm text-red-600 dark:text-red-300">
            <strong>When to stop and call a professional:</strong>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>You feel uncertain about any step</li>
              <li>The problem involves airbags, fuel systems, or structural components</li>
              <li>You don't have the proper tools or experience</li>
              <li>The car needs to be raised and you don't have proper stands</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>